    <section class="essay-questions" id="sect-00016">
    <title>Assessment: Essay Questions</title>
    <exercise id="exer-00008"><problem id="prob-00008"><para id="para-00040"><link class="os-embed" url="#exercise/12-04-LD-EQ01"/></para></problem></exercise>
    </section>
    <section class="references" id="sect-00017">
    <title>References</title>
    <para id="para-00041">Advocates for Life Skills &amp; Opportunity. (2023, May 25). <emphasis effect="italics">The importance of life skills for young adults with disabilities.</emphasis> https://alsoweb.org/nonprofit-blog/the-importance-of-life-skills-for-young-adults-with-disabilities/</para>
