    <glossary>
    <definition id="def-00001"><term>trajectory</term><meaning>predicted pathway of development, usually determined by the interaction of behaviors within context</meaning></definition>
    <definition id="def-00002"><term>work-life balance</term><meaning>arrangement that allows a person to spend the desired amount of time on activities that are important to them such as work, leisure, education, and caregiving</meaning></definition>
    </glossary>
</document>